        {
          "text": "Kitighintönchï Sedekia pöytoghin Nepukadnesa nyo kikikwigh Sedekia kwam muma lö, oteköy ompö kaynata Tororöt. Kïna kat Sedekia, akwigh mïkulöwunyi kwaghïghit amachamnye kïwaghaka wölo mi ECHOTYON Tororöt pö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
