        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh tïsï tïkwïl cho kile kintöghoghï nko pikö walak ngokï cho kighöy pipö punton nyo kimöminye chi nyonikïny nyo kitïngeto kighanat ompö Tororöt. Kisïmnyon Kö pö Tororöt nyo kitïlilchï kegh ompö Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
