          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurit kari Kö pö Tororöt löwïr cho echön nko cho mïnkech nko tïpö Kö pö Tororöt cho pö olyot nyo wow nko cho pö pöytoghin nko rïpaniskachi. Kurit tïkuchete löwïr kïpa Papilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpel Kö pö Tororöt akurultö nïyetwo Yerusalem akïpela ma kori pöytoghin cho pö paytagh akunyar kari löwïr cho pö olyot nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnam pich löwïr cho kichïwïtyeghö ngot akïrang kïpa Papilon kïlïkwï mötworichi nko cho pö werkachi tökïtenö kwit kitoröto paytaghpa Pasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
